1
00:00:45,854 --> 00:00:49,479
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,704 --> 00:00:51,104
(Longevity)

3
00:01:09,320 --> 00:01:11,039
(Young Taoist)

4
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:14,599
(Don't waste a night like this.)

5
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:19,920
Little Demoness.

6
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:21,920
What are you going to do?

7
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:25,320
I will take responsibility for you.

8
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:41,000
You pesky Taoist!

9
00:01:41,159 --> 00:01:41,840
You...

10
00:01:42,519 --> 00:01:43,840
You've turned into a man?

11
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:44,760
I...

12
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:51,679
(Whose face is this?)

13
00:01:52,132 --> 00:01:55,480
(Three Days Earlier)

14
00:01:55,615 --> 00:01:58,815
=Episode 1=

15
00:02:00,839 --> 00:02:04,532
(Demon Realm, Lanruo Hall)

16
00:02:07,553 --> 00:02:08,903
(Lanruo Hall)

17
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:12,519
(Shangguan Piaopiao, Lanruo Hall Madam)
(Desire is the key to heaven.)

18
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:14,880
(All demons welcome.)

19
00:02:15,199 --> 00:02:19,960
(Every soul seeks the elixir of ruin.)

20
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:22,239
Bring forth the courtesan.

21
00:02:22,519 --> 00:02:24,480
Shangguan Ziyan.

22
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:28,719
They say Lanruo's courtesan

23
00:02:28,719 --> 00:02:30,280
has never taken a guest.

24
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,239
Could tonight be

25
00:02:31,239 --> 00:02:32,760
my lucky night?

26
00:02:32,760 --> 00:02:35,840
One touch from her
and you're in paradise.

27
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:38,480
I'd die happy just for a taste!

28
00:02:38,507 --> 00:02:43,600
(Shangguan Ziyan, Lanruo Hall courtesan)

29
00:02:52,719 --> 00:02:55,639
Greed. Wrath. Obsession.
Lust. All poison.

30
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:58,400
You drank them down, craving more.

31
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:02,239
Now you can be my cure.

32
00:03:08,039 --> 00:03:09,440
(Spirit-Calling Art.)

33
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:11,119
(Mind snatch. Memory steal.)

34
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:13,440
(Demon Essence, come forth.)

35
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,440
(Serve my will.)

36
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:25,559
(Every time I call on the Divine Stone,)

37
00:03:26,239 --> 00:03:27,440
(the Stone Curse awakens,)

38
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:29,559
(consuming my body.)

39
00:03:34,239 --> 00:03:35,559
(Mortal Realm, Yuanzhen Sect)
(Fasting in solitude.)

40
00:03:36,199 --> 00:03:37,559
(Purging the heart's filth.)

41
00:03:38,519 --> 00:03:39,559
(Blind to karma.)

42
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,039
(Untouched by Love Ordeal.)

43
00:03:54,217 --> 00:03:57,958
(Yuanchu, Taoist of Yuanzhen Sect)

44
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,400
(After a thousand years,)

45
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:02,320
(why can I still sense her?)

46
00:04:03,480 --> 00:04:05,079
(Gather enough Demon Essence,)

47
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:07,639
(and I may reach Ninghua Palace.)

48
00:04:08,121 --> 00:04:10,255
(Ninghua Palace)

49
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:11,360
(Your Majesty,)

50
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:12,760
(a young demoness begs an audience.)

51
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,360
(She says she's the Saintess's sister.)

52
00:04:18,199 --> 00:04:19,960
(My sister sent word from the Palace.)

53
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:22,800
(The Demon King Yu Linjun
is the Bitemark Man.)

54
00:04:23,239 --> 00:04:24,039
(Consuming him)

55
00:04:24,079 --> 00:04:25,480
(shall lift my Stone Curse.)

56
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:29,199
What makes you think you're worthy

57
00:04:29,199 --> 00:04:31,519
of standing before me?

58
00:04:42,280 --> 00:04:44,239
I, Saintess Shangguan Ziyan,

59
00:04:45,119 --> 00:04:46,840
humbly invite Yu Linjun

60
00:04:47,280 --> 00:04:48,960
to grant me Transcendence of Desire.

61
00:04:52,602 --> 00:04:53,902
(Yu Linjun, Demon King)

62
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:55,960
(A demoness
who wields Spirit-Calling Art.)

63
00:04:56,440 --> 00:04:58,159
(Interesting.)

64
00:04:59,440 --> 00:05:00,320
Come.

65
00:05:07,559 --> 00:05:09,920
(Use Spirit-Calling Art
to check him for bite marks.)

66
00:05:15,679 --> 00:05:17,039
(Nothing?)

67
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:19,079
(My sister would never lie to me.)

68
00:05:28,559 --> 00:05:30,519
(Why is her spirit here?)

69
00:05:33,679 --> 00:05:35,079
(I'm sorry, Lanxi.)

70
00:05:36,159 --> 00:05:37,559
(I've made you worry again.)

71
00:05:37,598 --> 00:05:40,206
(Shangguan Lanxi, Saintess)

72
00:05:40,239 --> 00:05:42,920
(You're all I have in this world.)

73
00:05:43,519 --> 00:05:45,239
(Whatever it takes,)

74
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:48,440
(I will break the Stone Curse for you.)

75
00:05:50,519 --> 00:05:51,480
(Find him.)

76
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:52,800
(Consume him.)

77
00:05:53,760 --> 00:05:55,159
(Live.)

78
00:05:56,519 --> 00:05:57,880
(Live...)

79
00:05:58,400 --> 00:05:59,239
(Ziyan.)

80
00:06:00,159 --> 00:06:01,159
Where is my sister?

81
00:06:01,199 --> 00:06:05,400
She kept calling your name

82
00:06:05,400 --> 00:06:09,360
right up until I ate her.

83
00:06:09,599 --> 00:06:11,519
She was so sweet.

84
00:06:13,239 --> 00:06:14,199
And you

85
00:06:16,239 --> 00:06:18,719
make my mouth water as well.

86
00:06:18,960 --> 00:06:20,599
Once I feast on you,

87
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:25,079
I'll string you up on the Sacred Tree.

88
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:28,199
(It turns out
every ornate ornament here)

89
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:30,760
(is a girl he killed.)

90
00:06:33,679 --> 00:06:36,119
I'm taking your head.

91
00:06:36,159 --> 00:06:40,000
I will make all of Ninghua Palace
pay for my sister!

92
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,880
(Divine Stone Blossoms.)

93
00:06:54,519 --> 00:06:55,800
(She is actually the Divine Stone.)

94
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:02,639
(She blew herself up
using the Stone's power?)

95
00:07:17,519 --> 00:07:19,639
(This is the last time I help you.)

96
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:49,320
(She came after all.)

97
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:51,519
(Why did I fall from the sky?)

98
00:07:51,519 --> 00:07:53,960
(Has the Divine Stone's power
guided me here?)

99
00:07:56,679 --> 00:07:57,559
(The Bitemark Man.)

100
00:07:59,239 --> 00:08:01,280
(I looked everywhere for you.)

101
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:03,119
(And here you are,
just when I'm about to die.)

102
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:06,199
(I've run from you forever.)

103
00:08:06,679 --> 00:08:08,440
(Fate still found a way.)

104
00:08:09,679 --> 00:08:11,599
(If the mark shows and I eat you,)

105
00:08:11,599 --> 00:08:12,719
(the Stone Curse will break)

106
00:08:13,280 --> 00:08:14,639
(and my sister will come back.)

107
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:16,239
(Young Taoist.)

108
00:08:16,399 --> 00:08:19,800
(Think you can take one bite
of twenty years of my power?)

109
00:08:24,547 --> 00:08:25,989
(Thousand-Fold Love Ordeal)

110
00:08:26,039 --> 00:08:26,720
Love,

111
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:27,159
lose.

112
00:08:27,159 --> 00:08:28,359
(Phantom Yuanchu, Demon Illusion)
Over and over.

113
00:08:28,359 --> 00:08:29,319
You fool!

114
00:08:31,159 --> 00:08:31,880
(Look.)

115
00:08:31,880 --> 00:08:32,920
Love her again,

116
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,760
and you'll never escape.

117
00:08:35,319 --> 00:08:36,680
Stuck forever.

118
00:08:37,039 --> 00:08:38,399
Endless cycles repeat.

119
00:08:38,560 --> 00:08:39,920
No way out!

120
00:08:43,319 --> 00:08:44,560
What should I do, then?

121
00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:47,600
Kill her.

122
00:08:48,079 --> 00:08:50,000
Otherwise you will never master

123
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:51,960
the complete Wind God Chronicles.

124
00:08:55,439 --> 00:08:57,479
Killing's easy.

125
00:08:58,079 --> 00:08:59,359
Do I really need to teach you?

126
00:08:59,359 --> 00:09:00,760
Kill her.

127
00:09:01,439 --> 00:09:02,640
Kill her.

128
00:09:17,159 --> 00:09:18,960
(Why's he so angry?)

129
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,439
(The bite mark vanished?)

130
00:09:56,319 --> 00:09:57,479
We have never met before.

131
00:09:57,479 --> 00:09:58,960
So why pull a sword on me?

132
00:09:59,039 --> 00:10:00,920
You trapped me with demonic arts,

133
00:10:01,039 --> 00:10:02,159
so you are a demon.

134
00:10:02,319 --> 00:10:03,159
I'm a Taoist.

135
00:10:03,159 --> 00:10:05,159
Killing demons is what I do.

136
00:10:05,399 --> 00:10:06,680
If you were going to kill me,

137
00:10:06,760 --> 00:10:08,079
why stop your sword?

138
00:10:09,039 --> 00:10:09,840
Don't twist my words.

139
00:10:10,479 --> 00:10:11,279
Bound by Four.

140
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:17,840
I'm choking!

141
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:19,159
I will die!

142
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,000
Oh, heaven...

143
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:26,760
I'm stuck! I'm really dying!

144
00:10:32,119 --> 00:10:34,560
Keep your hands off my butt!

145
00:10:34,560 --> 00:10:37,000
Have you no shame?

146
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:43,760
Forget it, forget it.

147
00:10:44,159 --> 00:10:45,159
We good demons

148
00:10:45,159 --> 00:10:46,640
don't mess with filthy humans.

149
00:10:48,199 --> 00:10:49,479
Still being stubborn?

150
00:11:00,399 --> 00:11:01,199
Hey!

151
00:11:03,279 --> 00:11:04,239
You! Taoist!

152
00:11:04,920 --> 00:11:05,800
Put me down!

153
00:11:05,800 --> 00:11:07,640
Put me down, I said!

154
00:11:09,119 --> 00:11:10,920
Having fun over there, are you?

155
00:11:11,119 --> 00:11:12,239
You won't kill me,

156
00:11:12,239 --> 00:11:13,199
yet you won't set me free.

157
00:11:13,199 --> 00:11:14,720
Are you farming good karma or something?

158
00:11:18,279 --> 00:11:20,000
(What are you hesitating over?)

159
00:11:20,319 --> 00:11:21,359
(This demoness...)

160
00:11:21,760 --> 00:11:24,079
(is the reason you're trapped
in this ordeal.)

161
00:11:24,239 --> 00:11:26,560
(Kill her,
and you'll reach the Perfection.)

162
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:28,000
(What are you waiting for?)

163
00:11:29,760 --> 00:11:30,680
Yuanchu.

164
00:11:32,760 --> 00:11:33,560
Senior?

165
00:11:34,439 --> 00:11:36,760
Days of fasting. You must be starving.

166
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:39,279
I brought you so much food!

167
00:11:39,279 --> 00:11:41,159
Aren't you supposed to be with Master?

168
00:11:41,159 --> 00:11:42,199
Why are you back?

169
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:43,479
I...

170
00:11:45,159 --> 00:11:47,640
(Yuanlang, Yuanzhen Sect Taoist)
You look absolutely mouth-watering.

171
00:11:48,039 --> 00:11:51,119
Oh no, I mean you are beautiful.

172
00:11:51,560 --> 00:11:52,239
You are gorgeous.

173
00:11:52,439 --> 00:11:53,600
The finest candy in the mortal world.

174
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:54,880
Want some?

175
00:11:55,119 --> 00:11:56,279
Yes, please!

176
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:57,000
Here.

177
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:57,600
No.

178
00:11:57,760 --> 00:11:58,760
She's a demon.

179
00:11:59,359 --> 00:12:00,960
I was about to kill her.

180
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:03,760
Cold-hearted.

181
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:05,880
Eat first. Kill after.

182
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:06,720
Oh no, no.

183
00:12:06,880 --> 00:12:07,560
Eat now. Talk later.

184
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:08,760
Later.

185
00:12:09,479 --> 00:12:10,960
(Yuanchu, Yuanlang, come at once.)

186
00:12:11,079 --> 00:12:12,239
(Important matters to discuss.)

187
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:13,720
Master.

188
00:12:14,760 --> 00:12:17,479
(Our sect holds the Wind God's power,
hidden from the world.)

189
00:12:17,520 --> 00:12:19,239
(Yuanzhenzi, Yuanzhen Sect Master)
(We've sealed the Sky Rift for ages.)

190
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:20,840
(But sealing is not healing.)

191
00:12:21,439 --> 00:12:22,640
(Balance remains broken.)

192
00:12:23,279 --> 00:12:23,880
Master.

193
00:12:24,159 --> 00:12:24,760
Master.

194
00:12:25,239 --> 00:12:26,159
You called for us?

195
00:12:26,920 --> 00:12:28,800
The Rift is growing.

196
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:31,439
Creatures are slipping through,
attacking people.

197
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:34,600
We must find the Divine Stone
to mend the heavens.

198
00:12:35,800 --> 00:12:36,960
Yuanchu, Yuanlang,

199
00:12:37,079 --> 00:12:38,920
you two must set out at once.

200
00:12:39,039 --> 00:12:41,239
Find the Stone.
Mend the heavens and save the world.

201
00:12:41,239 --> 00:12:41,664
Understood.

202
00:12:42,399 --> 00:12:44,600
Where did that young Taoist go?

203
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:46,520
I must trigger his bite mark soon.

204
00:12:46,520 --> 00:12:48,399
Consuming him will cure my...

205
00:12:52,014 --> 00:12:55,605
(Chi Xiao, Lord Jin'an
Demon Hunting Supervisor)

206
00:12:55,640 --> 00:12:56,800
(Why does he look exactly)

207
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:57,760
(like Yu Linjun?)

208
00:12:58,239 --> 00:12:59,520
Who are you?

209
00:13:01,159 --> 00:13:02,399
This is not good. Run.

210
00:13:03,039 --> 00:13:03,600
Freeze.

211
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:10,560
Chi Xiao.

212
00:13:12,439 --> 00:13:13,720
I found a lead on the Divine Stone

213
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:15,359
at the Demon Hunting Bureau.

214
00:13:15,920 --> 00:13:16,720
I came straight for you.

215
00:13:17,439 --> 00:13:18,079
Divine Stone?

216
00:13:18,199 --> 00:13:19,479
In the Wilds of Lize,

217
00:13:19,479 --> 00:13:20,720
the Divine Stone has appeared.

218
00:13:21,039 --> 00:13:22,880
Xuanwu Sect is hosting
a Grand Demon Hunt.

219
00:13:23,319 --> 00:13:24,239
Word spreads across all lands.

220
00:13:24,239 --> 00:13:25,399
All compete for the Divine Stone.

221
00:13:25,640 --> 00:13:26,359
The Wilds of Lize

222
00:13:26,359 --> 00:13:27,319
is a remote land,

223
00:13:27,439 --> 00:13:28,880
where hell and paradise
stand side-by-side.

224
00:13:29,239 --> 00:13:30,079
To mend the sky and save mankind,

225
00:13:30,079 --> 00:13:30,920
we can't wait.

226
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:33,920
(There is another Divine Stone
in the mortal realm.)

227
00:13:34,520 --> 00:13:36,239
(If I obtain it,
I can revive my sister.)

228
00:13:37,239 --> 00:13:38,960
I know where it is.

229
00:13:39,319 --> 00:13:40,920
The Stone's location is a secret.

230
00:13:41,119 --> 00:13:43,880
A demon couldn't possibly know.

231
00:13:44,119 --> 00:13:45,640
You preach about saving the world,

232
00:13:45,640 --> 00:13:47,039
but you can't tell good from evil.

233
00:13:47,079 --> 00:13:47,960
My life

234
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:49,479
is not yours to take.

235
00:13:49,560 --> 00:13:51,439
The mortal world has less justice

236
00:13:51,439 --> 00:13:52,239
than the Void Realm.

237
00:13:52,479 --> 00:13:54,119
(She's exactly the same.)

238
00:13:54,479 --> 00:13:55,479
Demon.

239
00:13:57,560 --> 00:13:58,560
Must die.

240
00:13:59,159 --> 00:14:00,199
I can sense the Divine Stone.

241
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:12,319
A purple flower blooms on the Stone.

242
00:14:12,439 --> 00:14:13,680
Golden Lotus springs forth
from the earth.

243
00:14:13,680 --> 00:14:14,760
A spiritual root
that blossoms from within.

244
00:14:15,039 --> 00:14:17,920
That flower leads to the Stone.

245
00:14:18,039 --> 00:14:20,000
It's called the Purestone Bloom.

246
00:14:20,920 --> 00:14:24,560
Matches the Bureau's archives.

247
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:27,840
I've been apart from the Stone for ages.

248
00:14:29,079 --> 00:14:29,880
But now,

249
00:14:29,880 --> 00:14:32,239
only I can sense where it is.

250
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:35,479
So you can't kill me.

251
00:14:35,560 --> 00:14:37,159
You have to take me with you.

252
00:14:38,359 --> 00:14:39,439
She's got a point.

253
00:14:39,439 --> 00:14:41,119
Demon lies. Don't fall for it.

254
00:14:43,239 --> 00:14:44,399
Why do you want to help us?

255
00:14:46,079 --> 00:14:46,960
What if I said,

256
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:50,359
I just want to watch you righteous guys

257
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:51,800
fight over the Divine Stone

258
00:14:51,800 --> 00:14:53,720
and show faces uglier than demons.

259
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:54,680
Would you believe that?

260
00:15:00,279 --> 00:15:01,359
That's a lie.

261
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:04,199
I'm doing this for all living beings
in both realms.

262
00:15:09,199 --> 00:15:10,319
What are you doing?

263
00:15:10,479 --> 00:15:11,359
Let go of me.

264
00:15:11,359 --> 00:15:12,399
Our hands lock together.

265
00:15:23,439 --> 00:15:24,640
This chain binds karma,

266
00:15:24,720 --> 00:15:25,720
sharing life and senses.

267
00:15:25,760 --> 00:15:27,159
So you don't hurt anyone.

268
00:15:27,920 --> 00:15:29,720
You said you could find the Stone.

269
00:15:30,439 --> 00:15:31,680
Then prove it.

270
00:15:33,520 --> 00:15:34,439
Fine.

271
00:15:35,560 --> 00:15:37,479
Then you better keep a close eye on me.

272
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:40,560
Demons are everywhere out there.

273
00:15:40,760 --> 00:15:42,000
The Grand Demon Hunt

274
00:15:42,159 --> 00:15:43,840
is for official Hunters only.

275
00:15:44,199 --> 00:15:48,279
As Supervisor of the Huanxi Kingdom
Demon Hunting Bureau,

276
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:52,239
I hereby appoint you two
as official Hunters

277
00:15:52,319 --> 00:15:53,479
of the ninth rank.

278
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:54,479
I accept the commission.

279
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:00,920
And me?

280
00:16:00,920 --> 00:16:01,479
Demon.

281
00:16:02,119 --> 00:16:03,279
Talk again,

282
00:16:03,640 --> 00:16:04,159
and you die.

283
00:16:04,880 --> 00:16:05,279
Set out!

284
00:16:05,720 --> 00:16:06,520
Wait.

285
00:16:08,319 --> 00:16:09,960
Why keep yelling at her?

286
00:16:10,560 --> 00:16:12,239
Hot, fresh buns.

287
00:16:12,520 --> 00:16:13,560
Eat up before we go.

288
00:16:14,319 --> 00:16:15,319
I'll take one.

289
00:16:17,479 --> 00:16:18,520
Not for those two.

290
00:16:18,520 --> 00:16:19,000
Let's go.

291
00:16:24,978 --> 00:16:27,762
(Yong'an)

292
00:16:27,920 --> 00:16:28,479
Young Taoist.

293
00:16:28,479 --> 00:16:29,800
Hurry up.

294
00:16:30,680 --> 00:16:32,399
Your world's not half bad!

295
00:16:33,159 --> 00:16:35,600
(I have to find a way
to trigger the bite mark.)

296
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:37,840
You must be hot. Let me fan you.

297
00:16:38,119 --> 00:16:40,159
Let me fan you.

298
00:16:41,479 --> 00:16:45,079
(To be honest,
his collarbones are nice.)

299
00:16:46,680 --> 00:16:48,119
Whatever you're up to,

300
00:16:49,520 --> 00:16:51,039
drop your little schemes.

301
00:16:51,279 --> 00:16:53,279
Or I can kill you anytime.

302
00:16:55,439 --> 00:16:58,880
How could you kill me? I'm...

303
00:17:07,319 --> 00:17:08,119
Remember this:

304
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:11,239
never reveal your demon form
in front of mortals.

305
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:14,560
Yuanchu.

306
00:17:19,239 --> 00:17:20,880
Looks like there's a celebration
in the village ahead.

307
00:17:21,840 --> 00:17:22,640
Let's go check it out.

308
00:17:23,920 --> 00:17:24,880
A feast?

309
00:17:25,039 --> 00:17:26,000
Think they'll have braised pork?

310
00:17:27,199 --> 00:17:28,399
Glutton.

311
00:17:28,399 --> 00:17:29,520
Have some decency.

312
00:17:30,319 --> 00:17:33,560
Eating is the most important thing
in the world.

313
00:17:44,239 --> 00:17:45,520
I sense demonic energy!

314
00:17:45,880 --> 00:17:46,760
You fool.

315
00:17:46,760 --> 00:17:47,560
Get out of here fast!

316
00:18:03,399 --> 00:18:05,640
The Ghost Festival
forbids weddings and funerals.

317
00:18:06,520 --> 00:18:07,920
Holding a wedding today...

318
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:09,720
Something's not right.

319
00:18:11,680 --> 00:18:12,479
This is...

320
00:18:12,479 --> 00:18:13,600
a ghost wedding.

321
00:18:17,039 --> 00:18:18,000
(Young Taoist.)

322
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:20,359
(With this demon helping me now,)

323
00:18:20,359 --> 00:18:21,800
(I've got you.)

324
00:18:38,752 --> 00:18:42,680
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

325
00:18:42,952 --> 00:18:46,125
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

326
00:18:46,166 --> 00:18:49,680
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

327
00:18:49,866 --> 00:18:52,800
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

328
00:18:53,080 --> 00:18:59,850
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

329
00:19:00,496 --> 00:19:07,184
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

330
00:19:08,090 --> 00:19:11,760
♪Let towering waves come crashing down,
I'll fight against the tide♪

331
00:19:11,870 --> 00:19:15,560
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

332
00:19:15,732 --> 00:19:21,966
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
